{
  "slug": "claude-hwp-plugin",
  "name": "Claude Hwp Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Control HWP/HWPX Korean documents with natural language commands. Supports reading and summarizing documents, auto-filling form fields, batch generating documents from data, creating new HWPX files from markdown, and comparing document versions. Built on the kordoc library with full MCP integration for Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `hwp-agent` (HWP/HWPX 한글 문서를 자연어 명령으로 제어하는 AI 에이전트 스킬) and **1 MCP server**, `claude-hwp`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-hwp-plugin@claude-community` from `hyunmin625/claude-hwp-plugin`.\n\n한국 공공기관·기업 표준 문서 포맷인 HWP / HWPX 를 AI 에이전트로 자동화합니다.",
  "compatibility": [
